# Caddy reverse proxy: terminates HTTPS and forwards to the Next.js app on
# localhost:3000. Caddy fetches and renews the TLS cert automatically via
# Let's Encrypt (HTTP-01 challenge on port 80) -- no manual cert handling.
#
# Replace YOUR_VM_EXTERNAL_IP below with your VM's actual static external
# IP, dashes instead of dots (e.g. 34.123.45.67 -> 34-123-45-67). sslip.io
# is a public DNS service that resolves <anything>.<ip-with-dashes>.sslip.io
# straight to that IP -- it gets you a real, publicly resolvable hostname
# (which Let's Encrypt requires to issue a cert) without owning a domain.
#
# Install: see deploy/README-https.md in this folder for the full walkthrough.

YOUR_VM_EXTERNAL_IP.sslip.io {
	reverse_proxy localhost:3000
}
